{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act18side_level_act18side_05_beg",
  "groupId": "act18side",
  "stageId": "act18side_05",
  "title": "月光",
  "storyCode": "LE-5",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act18side/level_act18side_05_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "402243cc2aa7948ba928c7bcb727f942a2c3ddba94da9fbff51b17f2b5631812",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_482_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你现在感觉怎么样，没问题了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "没问题......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "没问题的，一定没问题的。你和我都会没问题的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我出去一会儿，你好好在这儿待着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_482_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你才刚好一点，这是要去哪里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#2$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......去办事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_482_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不管什么事，都等到你恢复再说吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不用担心我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_482_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "芙蓉也说了，如果醒了，最好休息一段时间，观察一下情况......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#8$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这是急事，很急的事，好吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_482_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可是我们离音乐会已经没多长时间了。我觉得现在最重要的还是把身体养好，加紧练习......这也是你的愿望啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#8$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "现在就别拿这个烦我了，好不好？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_482_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "烦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#9$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我不是这个意思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#2$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但我确实非去不可，别拦着我了。我会尽快回来的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_482_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "真的......不能告诉我要去做什么吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#2$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果一切顺利的话......你会知道的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "对了，衣服。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_482_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "衣服？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "约好今天下午去取的，我没法陪你去了，你自己去一趟吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "记得带大提琴，试穿的时候试着拉一小段，看看会不会有不舒服的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4047_pianst_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "又是你？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......是我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我来请求您停办这次音乐会，至少不要让黑键和白垩在音乐会上合奏了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4047_pianst_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你说什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果让黑键和白垩合奏，夕照区会出大事的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4047_pianst_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "按你的说法，我最近身体好转，是因为黑键和白垩引发的所谓“假愈”，但假愈期一过去，我就会变成重症患者，命在旦夕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是的，您和他们接触很多，因此症状也更明显。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4047_pianst_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "其他和他们接触较少的人也会受到影响，如果放任他们合奏，很可能有人死去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是的。虽然原因尚不明确，但让这两个人在一起合奏，有很大可能增强他们对周围的影响。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4047_pianst_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "多大可能？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "暂时还不知道......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4047_pianst_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "除了我，还有谁会因此面临生命危险？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......夕照区的十多人已经被送去高庭区的医院了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4047_pianst_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "高庭区......也就是说，他们已经离开了黑键和白垩的影响范围？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "应该是这样的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4047_pianst_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我明白你的意思了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那么......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4047_pianst_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "什么？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我不奢求您取消整场音乐会，但就算单独把黑键和白垩合奏的曲目撤了也好！或者换人也可以！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4047_pianst_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果你能证明他们的合奏一定会导致我以外的人受害，我立刻就取消这场音乐会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4047_pianst_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但现在不同，连你也无法得知合奏的后果究竟是什么。我不能仅仅因为虚无缥缈的“担忧”，就让整个夕照区的努力和希望付诸东流。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "整个夕照区的努力和希望？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我理解您对这次音乐会的重视程度，但是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4047_pianst_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你不理解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4047_pianst_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果你真的理解，就不会轻飘飘地说出那个“但是”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4047_pianst_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "很遗憾，我不能仅凭你的一面之词改动音乐会的安排。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "车尔尼先生，请您直接告诉我，这次音乐会和感染者的生命相比，究竟重要在什么地方？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4047_pianst_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你什么意思？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4047_pianst_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你是想说我漠视生命？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我只是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌尔苏拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_489_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "芙蓉，芙蓉！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "乌尔苏拉婆婆？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌尔苏拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_489_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "走，跟咱出去吹吹风，好不好？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌尔苏拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_489_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "走吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌尔苏拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_489_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "出去冷静一下，然后再说也不迟，好不好？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（如果格特鲁德说的全部都是真的，白垩不可能活下来......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（不，一定有什么办法的......两全其美的办法......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（车尔尼，车尔尼说不定能知道什么......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（不，他只是个音乐家，他帮不上忙的。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（我要不要告诉白垩实情——）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（可那又有什么用呢......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（罗德岛......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（芙蓉那种人，只会让我回乌提卡继续坐牢！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（女皇之声？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（我到底在想什么，自杀计划吗？！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（不行，我一直在这儿兜圈子，实在太可疑了。我得换个人少的地方......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（嗯？那人有点眼熟。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "轻浮的贵族",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_492_1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......谨慎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可疑的感染者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_488_1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......人群......保证。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（对了，谣言，那个谣言！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（把谣言查清楚，没准能获得什么线索，或者知道散布谣言的人是在传递什么信息！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（但现在只能靠我自己了......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "轻浮的贵族",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_492_1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你确定？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可疑的感染者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_488_1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "现在就是最好的时机了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可疑的感染者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_488_1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "再拖下去，时间越来越少，到那时就不好办了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "轻浮的贵族",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_492_1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那好，你尽管去做，我去向上面报告。加油，拉赫曼先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉赫曼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_488_1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉，这活可真是劳心又劳力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉赫曼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_488_1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "散布流言也就罢了，现在还要去那种地方......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（下水道？他要进下水道？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（我可不想跟他进去......该动手了。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "站住。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉赫曼",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "谁？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "别回头。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "说，是什么人派你来夕照区传播谣言的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉赫曼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "冤枉啊，我不过是道听途说......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我跟了你一路了，拉赫曼先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而且我刚刚认出来，之前传播谣言围攻芙蓉的时候，你是煽风点火的那一个。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉赫曼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您记性不错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "说说吧，谁派你做这些事的，你进下水道要做什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "正好，我也很好奇，拉赫曼先生进下水道要做什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "别回头，否则......"
    },
